// Phase 3: We advance steps by budget (worst-case cost per API contract).
//   The helper's postcondition guarantees |resultConstrained| <= budget.
//   Since currentConstrainedOut == [] before the call, stablePrefix = generated,
//   so new |generated| = old |generated| + |resultConstrained|
//   <= |generatedPrefix| + steps_before + budget = |generatedPrefix| + steps_after. ✓
//
